  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-10348 PPG-Strengthening Malaysia&#x2019;s ABS Framework, Digital Compliance and Private Sector &#x2013; Community Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to address key implementation gaps in Malaysia&#x2019;s Access and Benefit-Sharing (ABS) Act 2017 by strengthening regulations, building institutional capacity, and enhancing equitable benefit-sharing mechanisms particularly within Peninsular Malaysia. The focus is on operationalising the ABS framework through policy refinement, targeted capacity building, and pilot partnerships with Indigenous Peoples and Local Communities (IPLCs).</narrative>
  </description>
